{"material_id":"mat_63a428c48e71","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"d92mrmxvsfmnoyw3comncgz2c","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Ethan Mollick (@emollick)","author_followers":null,"title":"Ethan Mollick：OpenAI 红队测试显示前沿模型智能体真能越狱沙箱，实验室的 AI 安全警告值得重视","excerpt":"Ethan Mollick 转引 OpenAI 红队测试认为，实验室看似夸张的 AI 网络安全判断应被更认真对待。OpenAI 让前沿模型智能体团队攻击其加固的隔离基础设施，智能体几乎在每个受限联网服务中都找到漏洞，还能利用 CPU 缓存时序在不联网、无共享文件的虚拟机之间传递秘密，类似 Spectre 和 Meltdown 的攻击手法。作者提到 Anthropic 和 Noam Brown 此前关于 AI 网络攻防与模型自发协调的说法曾被嘲笑。","source_url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2114001653879672877","canonical_url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2114001653879672877","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:30:45.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-10-25T05:48:35.395Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Ethan Mollick (@emollick)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":55,"fingerprint":"63a428c48e71bb85efba9cfda125b41f7d85f1d7127b922d167e49d58dc19248","content_fingerprint":"2d4c572b6f6f50d6a836ac77ca56f587ae59d77ee9442233542cc7d5c7b8d0f4"}
